    "reason": "They are supplied by the shell and not stated.",
    "answer": "TIMEOUT_CYCLES is 100000. BUILD_STAMP is not specified, so no value can be given for it. The proposed default of 1000000 for TIMEOUT_CYCLES does not match the specification.",
